flowchart TB
    Input[Customer and order payload] --> LockCustomer[Validate ownership and lock customer]
    LockCustomer --> Key{Idempotency key exists?}
    Key -->|Same customer and payload| Existing[Return existing order]
    Key -->|Different request| Conflict[409 conflict]
    Key -->|New key| Stock[Lock candidate balances in stable order]
    Stock --> Eligible{One warehouse has every item?}
    Eligible -->|No| Reject[409 and rollback]
    Eligible -->|Yes| Reserve[Reserve units]
    Reserve --> Cost[Round line prices and simulated charges]
    Cost --> Records[Create order lines - payment authorization - shipment - audit]
    Records --> Commit[Commit all records together]
    Commit --> Lifecycle[Controlled shipment lifecycle]
